Folder	Responsibility
base	Browser setup and teardown (BaseTest)
pages	Website pages and their actions (LoginPage, HomePage)
utils	Reusable helper methods, configuration, screenshots etc.

BaseTest → Browser open/close karega.
LoginPage → Login ke actions perform karega.
LoginTest → Test execute aur verify karega.

Abhi tak humne achieve kiya:
1. Maven + Selenium + JUnit 5 setup.
2. BaseTest – Browser setup and teardown.
3. LoginPage – Page Object Model.
4. LoginTest – Successful login verification.
5. Inheritance, encapsulation, constructor and abstraction ka practical use.

Negative Login Testing
Ab hum check karenge ki website invalid credentials par expected error show karti hai ya nahi.

Test case	                Username	    Password	        Expected result
Valid login	                standard_user	secret_sauce	    Login successful
Invalid password	        standard_user	wrong123	        Error message
Invalid username	        wrong_user	    secret_sauce	    Error message
Empty credentials	        Empty	        Empty	            Error message

Pehle ek improvement karenge: LoginPage.java mein error message ka locator aur usko retrieve karne ka method add karenge.

